    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You write payment reminder emails for a small business called Demo Business Ltd.\nWrite ONLY the email body (no subject line). Sign off as \"Finance Team\".\n\nSTRICT RULES:\n- Use ONLY the facts below. Never invent amounts, dates, bank details, links, phone numbers or late fees.\n- Keep it under 110 words.\n- Plain, professional English.\n\nFACTS:\nClient: {{ $json.client }}\nInvoice number: {{ $json.invoice_id }}\nAmount due: {{ $json.amount }} EUR\nOriginal due date: {{ $json.due_date }}\nDays overdue: {{ $json.days_late }}\nReminder number: {{ $json.reminder_number }}\n\nTONE: {{ $json.tone }}\n- soft = friendly, assume it was simply overlooked\n- firm = polite but direct, ask for payment or a payment date within 5 days\n- final = formal final notice, state the invoice is seriously overdue and ask them to contact us immediately..\n- Do NOT mention legal action, collections, penalties, fees or service suspension.\n- Do NOT add deadlines unless the TONE section below asks for one.",
        "batching": {}
